    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "L-glutamine and crizanlizumab target vaso-occlusion and reduced pain crises, but data on efficacy are limited and conflicting."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
